1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:11,500
Welcome to NeuroTeach AI, an Adaptive Pedagogical Learning Companion engineered with Misconception DNA, Anti-Leakage Guardrails, and a fine-tuned Qwen 3.5 4B LoRA adapter.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Starting on the Home Dashboard, our Markov Failure-State Policy continuously prioritizes personalized interventions, tracking daily concept goals and active misconceptions.

3
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:35,000
In Ask Neuro, when a student submits an incorrect formula, our Socratic engine identifies the exact conceptual flaw, selecting counterexamples rather than giving away the answer.

4
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:46,000
Evaluators can also input any custom problem, such as what is photosynthesis or binary search invariants, and receive contextual Socratic discovery questions.

5
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:56,800
The integrated Visual Pattern Lab features real-time Cartesian graphs with interactive parameter sliders, paired with a browser-native voice assistant for audio reinforcement.

6
00:00:57,200 --> 00:01:07,000
Our Subject Roadmap visualizes prerequisite concept dependencies, while the Evaluator computes Bayesian mastery breakdowns and transfer verification.

7
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:16,200
Crafted with seamless Dark and Light theme support, NeuroTeach AI is live and ready for evaluation at neuroteach-ai.vercel.app.
